.th PASSWD I 5/31/77
.sh NAME
passwd \*- change login password
.sh SYNOPSIS
.bd passwd
name password
.sh DESCRIPTION
The
.it password
becomes associated with the given login
.it name.
This can only be done by the user who has that login name,
or by the super-user.
An explicit null argument ("") for the
.it password
argument removes
any password.
.sh FILES
/etc/passwd
.sh "SEE ALSO"
login(I), passwd(V), crypt(III)
